    text: "Affected stops:\r\n12th Ave & Humboldt St (#10170) (eastbound)\r\n12th Ave & Gilpin St (#10188) (eastbound)\r\n12th Ave & Race St (#10179) (eastbound)\r\n12th Ave & Race St (#10180) (westbound)\r\n12th Ave & Gilpin St (#10189) (westbound)\r\n12th Ave & Humboldt St (#10171) (westbound)\r\n12th Ave & Downing St (#10161) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 10 get on/off buses at:\r\n12th Ave & Corona St (#10160)\r\n12th Ave & York St (#10190)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 10 get on/off buses at:\r\n12th Ave & Josephine St (#10174)\r\n12th Ave & Washington St (#10187)"
